{"sba-sakura-37439":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYVMKJDXDMEJM0XPS7VVA1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n #ゆみこかめら\n \n \n \n 新成人の皆さん、ご成人おめでとうございます！\n 気が付けば、あっという間に過ぎていく時間を一緒に、大切に過ごしていきましょうね☺︎\n このようなご時世ですが皆の目標がたくさん叶いますように！\n 幸せいっぱいな一年になりますように、心から願っています。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 9日、10日はミーグリでした！\n お話しにきてくださった皆さんありがとうございました☺︎\n 振袖やスーツでお話ししてくれた新成人のみんなもありがとう( ¨̮ )\n すごくお似合いだったよー！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYVNR9BGAW8WHP672QC1TV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYVQ12F04CTJN8DZZTZBWM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYVR6YX4ES0E0Y01WSE2TS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYVSFJ16KBPPQK702S6M54","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n いろんな髪型をしました。\n こんなにヘアアレンジをやっていただけるのもミーグリならではだなー☺︎\n と言っても私の意見はあんまりなくてメイクさんの気分だったり、遊ばれてます（笑）\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYVWJHZ2MQCYWK5HP1980D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n みいちゃんとおそろい☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYVXWA7PBH7ZK93TD4XKR4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYVZDTPH56MMEA8C2C85F6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n そこさくの振袖赤だったー☺︎\n \n \n \n \n \n じゃあ、今日はここまでです！\n \n \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！\n \n \n 関有美子🐱             "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-21563":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校1年16歳！O型和田まあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生まあや第二弾！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、この前行われた文化祭の写メをっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前に！スッピンだからそれでもよかったらどうぞ！！！ほんとうにっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまり出れなかったけど少しの時間でめっちゃ食べ物もとかまわったりしましたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたあめに、タピオカ、たこ焼きに、パンケーキ‥‥もうたっくさんたっくさん食べましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそうそう\n私達のクラスは学園ものの映画みたいなのを皆んなでつくりました～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放課後や朝、みんなで撮影しましよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの役は、なんとなんとぉぉぉ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"英語の先生役で～すっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやにピッタリでしょ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップルじゃなくてアポウだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナじゃなくてバナーナだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってみんなに教えてあげましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆んなにバカにされながらもまあや頑張ったっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは続いて授業のまあやを～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意な絵を！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術の授業で書いたものをお見せしましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0020.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真ん中のは模型なんだけど、\n模型を主役に書かないといけないんだけど模型目立ててるかなぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやメイクさんにはすっごくすっごく好評だったんだけど‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生には\n(もう少しリアリティーを追求しましょう！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われした‥‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0024.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事のちゃんとしたまあやの写メものせとかなきゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてみりりんhappyバースデー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１期生と2期生の最年少っていう共通点～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもかわいくてクールなみりりんでいてね良いお年を‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0027.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前のブログ、初コメさんも沢山いて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755についてもみんな意見くれてありがとう御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょっとちゃんと考えて決めたいな！って思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの方もコメントとかありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんないつもお世話になっているみなさん！特別に～‥‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのロングヘアー見たい人～？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今日も満員電車に揺られて学校行って参ります‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/06/2774514/0031.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-55327":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"   本日、トップ目です！ 5戦目となる今回の対局ゲストは ハマカーン・浜谷健司さん日刊スポーツ記者・横山慧さん番組プロデューサー・竹中優介さん  浜谷さんは早くもトップ目2度目の出演です！ありがとうございます～ そして、横山さんと竹中さん 皆さんはどこまで知ってるかわかりませんが本当にたくさんお世話になっていて中田的にはお馴染みなのです 日向坂ちゃんのゆかりのある方々というくくりで出てくれましたが私的にはだいぶリラックスして打てた対局ゲストの皆さんでした！(笑) 応援ゲストはあやてぃーです！ 観てね～  24:00～25:00 TBSチャンネル1「乃木坂46中田花奈の麻雀ガチバトル！かなりんのトップ目とれるカナ？」      本日、FNSに出演させていただきます！ ありがたいです。 みんな観てね～よろしくお願いします～ 19:00～22:00 フジテレビ系「緊急生放送！FNS音楽特別番組 春は必ず来る」      明日、日曜日は熱闘！Mリーグに出演させてもらいます！ セミファイナル始まりましたね～ 推しのチームがいなくてもずっとわくわくして見てられますね Mリーガー皆さん好きなんだろうな～ 3/21(日)24:59～「熱闘！Mリーグ」  "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFNBC8Y1V6WB6ZXS39RSS50","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> つーん    昨日は沈金でした！ アルピーさんが別のお仕事のためまさかのまあやと2人でやらせていただきました  テーマは「まあやの失敗しそうな事」 コーナーは・和田まあやの名作劇場・嘘なの？本当なの？ライアーメール・しあわせの保護色の前に読みたいメール～・小5の頃の4つでした！  それぞれフリートークなんかもしてみたりいつもの沈金とはかけ離れた放送になったかなと思います なのにいつもの職人の方もたくさんメールをくれて嬉しかったです  まあやが天才でずっと面白くて助けられましたまあや本当にありがとうね！   因みに沈金パーカー 白と黒が受注販売中です！ 白は新色だよ～春にぴったり～ 中田もいただきました！着ようね～  聴いてくださった皆さんありがとうございました なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20340":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばーんは\n \n 映画が見たくて見たくてたまらないのだけど\n つい他のことを優先して気付いたら夜中\n っていうのを毎日繰り返しています。\n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n 明日は握手ですね〜〜(o^^o)\n \n 一週間ぶり！\n \n まなふぃーとペアやで〜〜\n 関西弁がうつりそうやわ〜〜\n \n エセです。ごめんなさい。笑\n \n 私服は何を着ようかな〜〜って\n ずーっと考えています。\n 楽しみにしててね(・∀・)\n \n \n あ、叫んでっていわれたらできるだけ全力で応えます。\n \n が！しかし！！\n \n 幕張メッセを私の声でいっぱいにしちゃうと\n 他のレーンの方々の迷惑になるので\n 全力じゃないじゃんって怒らないで下さいo(`^´)o笑\n \n \n \n ではまたね(　˙-˙　)/\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZK4JNEJ2KJF8TECQ1R1V5G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22388":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、どういうこと？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、どんな感想？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台『ヴァンパイア騎士』公演直前！稽古場に潜入生中継！の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","te